class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{rfn}_G(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{rfn}_G(\\varphi)\\)</span>是句子<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>的一条局部反射实例，而不是外部真值判断</li>\n<li>它在对象语言中表示“若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>可证<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>”；把该句作为新公理与在元语言中声称它为真是不同层次</li>\n<li>取固定矛盾句时，该实例与内部一致性句密切相关；一般的局部反射实例不能统称为同一个一致性陈述</li>\n<li>用于分析系统G的元理论性质</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"b78092e29a02d697","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_G$ (sentence, see [[92-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prov}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G$ (intern